ticles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval'&gt;德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deutsche Boerse’s €5.3 billion Allfunds Deal Gets EU Approval&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 前媒体高管承认，澳大利亚儿童性虐待幸存者“希望再次被强奸”</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckr5grlq78n9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>这位前默多克媒体高管在一次活动中无意中提到格蕾丝·塔姆的着装。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckr5grlq78n9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;前媒体高管承认，澳大利亚儿童性虐待幸存者“希望再次被强奸”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ex-media executive admits saying Australian child sex abuse survivor 'looking to be raped again'&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckr5grlq78n9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:44:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 印度最富有的公民机构将向零售买家开放债券销售</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers</link><description>印度最富有的孟买市政当局计划通过未来的债券销售吸引个人投资者，为城市基础设施项目提供融资。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers'&gt;印度最富有的公民机构将向零售买家开放债券销售&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India’s Richest Civic Body Will Open Bond Sales to Retail Buyers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/india-s-richest-civic-body-will-open-bond-sales-to-retail-buyers</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:59:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><ti